{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AcSYuKVQ9ToW6YAS7SPSqn","type":"tool_result","content":"173:## 4. Overlay: sponsors-thanks.html\n174-\n175-**File**: `overlays/sponsors-thanks.html`\n176-\n177-**Follow existing overlay conventions** (see `overlays/event-frame.html`, `overlays/hosts.html`):\n178-- Viewport: `<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=1920, height=1080\">`\n179-- Font: Google Fonts Inter\n180-- Reset: `* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }`\n181-- Body: `width: 1920px; height: 1080px; overflow: hidden;`\n182-- URL params via: `const params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);`\n183-\n184-**Header bar** (match overlay pattern):\n185-- Gray header bar (`#BFBFBF` background)\n186-- Title: \"THANK YOU TO OUR SPONSORS\" (left side)\n187-- Team logo (80x80, `object-fit: contain`) — far right\n188-- `background: transparent` for the body\n189-\n190-**URL params**:\n191-- `?logo={teamLogoUrl}` — team logo for the header bar\n192-- `?sponsors={encodedJSON}` — JSON array of `[{name, url}]` objects\n193-\n194-**Rendering**: Parse `sponsors` param, render logos in a CSS grid. Auto-sizing: 1-2 sponsors = single row; 3-4 = 2x2; 5-8 = 2 rows. Each sponsor: logo (200x200, `object-fit: contain`) + name below (24px).\n195-\n196-**Error handling**:\n197-\n198-| Condition | Behavior |\n199-|-----------|----------|\n200-| Missing/empty `?logo=` | Hide header logo element (`display:none`) |\n201-| Missing/empty `?sponsors=` | Show centered \"No sponsors configured\" |\n202-| Invalid JSON in `?sponsors=` | `try/catch` around `JSON.parse`; show \"No sponsors configured\" |\n203-| Empty array `[]` | Show \"No sponsors configured\" |\n204-| Broken sponsor logo URL | `img.onerror`: hide broken img, show fallback div with sponsor name in styled box |\n205-| Long sponsor name | `text-overflow: ellipsis; max-width: 200px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden;` |\n206-\n207-> **Why URL params instead of Firebase**: All 16 existing overlay files use URL params exclusively — none use Firebase. This keeps overlays stateless, cacheable, and resilient to Firebase outages. The URL Builder serializes sponsor data from the React app (which already has the Firebase subscription) into the URL.\n208-\n209----\n210-\n211-## 5. Overlay: sponsors-cycle.html\n212-\n213-**File**: `overlays/sponsors-cycle.html`\n214-\n215-Same gray header bar as sponsors-thanks (`#BFBFBF`, title: \"OUR SPONSORS\", team logo on right).\n216-\n217-**Below the header**: One sponsor logo at a time, centered, large (~600px max, `object-fit: contain`). Sponsor name below logo (36px Inter bold). Crossfade transition (CSS opacity, 0.5s). 3-second hold. Continuous loop via `setInterval`.\n218-\n219-**URL params**: Same as sponsors-thanks.\n220-\n221-**Error handling**:\n222-\n223-| Condition | Behavior |\n224-|-----------|----------|\n225-| Missing/empty/invalid `?sponsors=` | Header + centered \"No sponsors\" message; no cycling |\n226-| Empty array `[]` | Same as missing |\n227-| 1 sponsor | Static display — no `setInterval`, no transitions |\n228-| Broken logo during cycle | `img.onerror` → call `advanceToNext()` immediately (skip broken sponsor) |\n229-| ALL logos broken | Track `brokenCount`; if equals `sponsors.length`, switch to text-only mode (show just names) |\n230-\n231-**Note on live updates**: URL-param-based overlays are static once loaded. If sponsors change mid-broadcast, the producer must regenerate and reload the URL in OBS. This matches every other overlay in the system.\n232-\n233----\n234-\n235-## 6. Overlay: sponsors-bug.html (NEW)\n236-\n237-**File**: `overlays/sponsors-bug.html`\n238-\n239-This is a **transparent overlay** designed to be composited in OBS on top of the live feed. It shows a small sponsor logo cycling in the bottom-right corner.\n240-\n241-**Viewport**: 1920x1080, transparent body (`background: transparent`).\n242-\n243-**No header bar** — this is a persistent bug, not a full-screen graphic.\n244-\n245-**Layout**:\n246-- Single container: `position: fixed; bottom: 40px; right: 40px; width: 200px; height: 80px;`\n247-- Semi-transparent dark pill background: `background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4); border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px;`\n248-- Single `<img>` inside, `object-fit: contain`, cycling through sponsors\n249-- Fade transition: opacity 0→1, 0.8s duration\n250-- Hold: 10 seconds per sponsor\n251-- Continuous loop\n252-\n253-**URL params**:\n254-- `?sponsors={encodedJSON}` — JSON array of `[{name, url}]` objects\n255-- No `?logo=` param (no header bar)\n256-\n257-**Error handling**:\n258-\n259-| Condition | Behavior |\n260-|-----------|----------|\n261-| Missing/empty/invalid `?sponsors=` | Render nothing (fully transparent page) |\n262-| Empty array `[]` | Same as missing |\n263-| 1 sponsor | Static display, no cycling |\n264-| Broken logo URL | `img.onerror` → skip to next; if ALL broken → hide container (`display:none`) |\n265-\n266----\n267-\n268-## 7. Graphics Registry\n269-\n270-**File**: `show-controller/src/lib/graphicsRegistry.js` — add new `sponsors` category section before closing `};` at line 945.\n271-\n272-**IMPORTANT**: Use a new `'sponsors'` category, NOT `'stream'`, to avoid keyword collision with existing `stream-thanks` (which has keywords `['stream', 'thanks', 'watching', 'end', 'goodbye']`).\n273-"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"abab19df-d0a7-4bbd-b5eb-5c2875031231","uuid":"cf0142de-90af-449c-a874-328e0c3fef88","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"173:## 4. Overlay: sponsors-thanks.html\n174-\n175-**File**: `overlays/sponsors-thanks.html`\n176-\n177-**Follow existing overlay conventions** (see `overlays/event-frame.html`, `overlays/hosts.html`):\n178-- Viewport: `<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=1920, height=1080\">`\n179-- Font: Google Fonts Inter\n180-- Reset: `* { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }`\n181-- Body: `width: 1920px; height: 1080px; overflow: hid