{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015JSkaDeoTjMEc8UVvQsjNM","type":"tool_result","content":"211:## 5. Overlay: sponsors-cycle.html\n212-\n213-**File**: `overlays/sponsors-cycle.html`\n214-\n215-Same gray header bar as sponsors-thanks (`#BFBFBF`, title: \"OUR SPONSORS\", team logo on right).\n216-\n217-**Below the header**: One sponsor logo at a time, centered, large (~600px max, `object-fit: contain`). Sponsor name below logo (36px Inter bold). Crossfade transition (CSS opacity, 0.5s). 3-second hold. Continuous loop via `setInterval`.\n218-\n219-**URL params**: Same as sponsors-thanks.\n220-\n221-**Error handling**:\n222-\n223-| Condition | Behavior |\n224-|-----------|----------|\n225-| Missing/empty/invalid `?sponsors=` | Header + centered \"No sponsors\" message; no cycling |\n226-| Empty array `[]` | Same as missing |\n227-| 1 sponsor | Static display — no `setInterval`, no transitions |\n228-| Broken logo during cycle | `img.onerror` → call `advanceToNext()` immediately (skip broken sponsor) |\n229-| ALL logos broken | Track `brokenCount`; if equals `sponsors.length`, switch to text-only mode (show just names) |\n230-\n231-**Note on live updates**: URL-param-based overlays are static once loaded. If sponsors change mid-broadcast, the producer must regenerate and reload the URL in OBS. This matches every other overlay in the system.\n232-\n233----\n234-\n235-## 6. Overlay: sponsors-bug.html (NEW)\n236-\n237-**File**: `overlays/sponsors-bug.html`\n238-\n239-This is a **transparent overlay** designed to be composited in OBS on top of the live feed. It shows a small sponsor logo cycling in the bottom-right corner.\n240-\n241-**Viewport**: 1920x1080, transparent body (`background: transparent`).\n242-\n243-**No header bar** — this is a persistent bug, not a full-screen graphic.\n244-\n245-**Layout**:\n246-- Single container: `position: fixed; bottom: 40px; right: 40px; width: 200px; height: 80px;`\n247-- Semi-transparent dark pill background: `background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4); border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px;`\n248-- Single `<img>` inside, `object-fit: contain`, cycling through sponsors\n249-- Fade transition: opacity 0→1, 0.8s duration\n250-- Hold: 10 seconds per sponsor\n251-- Continuous loop\n252-\n253-**URL params**:\n254-- `?sponsors={encodedJSON}` — JSON array of `[{name, url}]` objects\n255-- No `?logo=` param (no header bar)\n256-\n257-**Error handling**:\n258-\n259-| Condition | Behavior |\n260-|-----------|----------|\n261-| Missing/empty/invalid `?sponsors=` | Render nothing (fully transparent page) |\n262-| Empty array `[]` | Same as missing |\n263-| 1 sponsor | Static display, no cycling |\n264-| Broken logo URL | `img.onerror` → skip to next; if ALL broken → hide container (`display:none`) |\n265-\n266----\n267-\n268-## 7. Graphics Registry\n269-\n270-**File**: `show-controller/src/lib/graphicsRegistry.js` — add new `sponsors` category section before closing `};` at line 945.\n271-\n272-**IMPORTANT**: Use a new `'sponsors'` category, NOT `'stream'`, to avoid keyword collision with existing `stream-thanks` (which has keywords `['stream', 'thanks', 'watching', 'end', 'goodbye']`).\n273-\n274-```js\n275-// ============================================================\n276-// SPONSOR GRAPHICS\n277-// ============================================================\n278-\n279-'sponsors-thanks': {\n280-  id: 'sponsors-thanks',\n281-  label: 'Sponsor Thank You',"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"17c6171e-a074-4815-a2f4-dbf271aea37e","uuid":"7d3929e4-b1af-4798-a354-f10d5485bf42","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"211:## 5. Overlay: sponsors-cycle.html\n212-\n213-**File**: `overlays/sponsors-cycle.html`\n214-\n215-Same gray header bar as sponsors-thanks (`#BFBFBF`, title: \"OUR SPONSORS\", team logo on right).\n216-\n217-**Below the header**: One sponsor logo at a time, centered, large (~600px max, `object-fit: contain`). Sponsor name below logo (36px Inter bold). Crossfade transition (CSS opacity, 0.5s). 3-second hold. Continuous loop via `setInterval`.\n218-\n219-**URL params**: Same as sponsors-thanks.\n220-\n221-**Error handling**:\n222-\n223-| Condition | Behavior |\n224-|-----------|----------|\n225-| Missing/empty/invalid `?sponsors=` | Header + centered \"No sponsors\" message; no cycling |\n226-| Empty array `[]` | Same as missing |\n227-| 1 sponsor | Static display — no `setInterval`, no transitions |\n228-| Broken logo during cycle | `img.onerror` → call `advanceToNext()` immediately (skip broken sponsor) |\n229-| ALL logos broken | Track `brokenCount`; if equals `sponsors.length`, switch to text-only mode (show just names) |\n230-\n231-**Note on live updates**: URL-param-based overlays are static once loaded. If sponsors change mid-broadcast, the producer must regenerate and reload the URL in OBS. This matches every other overlay in the system.\n232-\n233----\n234-\n235-## 6. Overlay: sponsors-bug.html (NEW)\n236-\n237-**File**: `overlays/sponsors-bug.html`\n238-\n239-This is a **transparent overlay** designed to be composited in OBS on top of the live feed. It shows a small sponsor logo cycling in the bottom-right corner.\n240-\n241-**Viewport**: 1920x1080, transparent body (`background: transparent`).\n242-\n243-**No header bar** — this is a persistent bug, not a full-screen graphic.\n244-\n245-**Layout**:\n246-- Single container: `position: fixed; bottom: 40px; right: 40px; width: 200px; height: 80px;`\n247-- Semi-transparent dark pill background: `background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4); border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px;`\n248-- Single `<img>` inside, `object-fit: contain`, cycling through sponsors\n249-- Fade transition: opacity 0→1, 0.8s duration\n250-- Hold: 10 seconds per sponsor\n251-- Continuous loop\n252-\n253-**URL params**:\n254-- `?sponsors={encodedJSON}` — JSON array of `[{name, url}]` objects\n255-- No `?logo=` param (no header bar)\n256-\n257-**Error handling**:\n258-\n259-| Condition | Behavior |\n260-|-----------|----------|\n261-| Missing/empty/invalid `?sponsors=` | Render nothing (fully transparent page) |\n262-| Empty array `[]` | Same as missing |\n263-| 1 sponsor | Static display, no cycling |\n264-| Broken logo URL | `img.onerror` → skip to next; if ALL broken → hide container (`display:none`) |\n265-\n266----\n267-\n268-## 7. Graphics Registry\n269-\n270-**File**: `show-controller/src/lib/graphicsRegistry.js` — add new `sponsors` category section before closing `};` at line 945.\n271-\n272-**IMPORTANT**: Use a new `'sponsors'` category, NOT `'stream'`, to avoid keyword collision with existing `stream-thanks` (which has keywords `['stream', 'thanks', 'watching', 'end', 'goodbye']`).\n273-\n274-```js\n275-// ============================================================\n276-// SPONSOR GRAPHICS\n277-// ============================================================\n278-\n279-'sponsors-thanks': {\n280-  id: 'sponsors-thanks',\n281-  label: 'Sponsor Thank You',","numLines":71}}
